# 25. Gradual PSS Adoption

For an existing production cluster, immediately enforcing Restricted may break existing workloads.

A safer migration approach is:

```text
Existing Namespace
        │
        ▼
      WARN
        │
        ▼
      AUDIT
        │
        ▼
Fix workloads
        │
        ▼
    ENFORCE
```

For example:

```yaml
pod-security.kubernetes.io/warn: restricted
```

First identify violations.

Then:

```yaml
pod-security.kubernetes.io/audit: restricted
```

Track violations.

After workloads are remediated:

```yaml
pod-security.kubernetes.io/enforce: restricted
```

This is useful for adopting security controls without unexpectedly breaking applications.

